first off, if you're the sort to exploit a %$!#@!*()_ loophole then
your 1st wish from a wand of wishing is the obligatory:

3 blessed scrolls of charging

this will extend your good fortune ...

if you're high-minded and avoid these easy outs then ... well ...
my first wish in your shoes would be:

a blessed +3 gray dragon scale mail

why? - great armor class with magic resistance thrown in.  magic
resistance is subtle and very powerful (later in the game).
if i get another wish then:

a blessed +2 war hammer named Mjollnir

or whatever your favorite weapon is.  now you've significantly improved
your offensive and defensive odds.  it is unlikely that a hobbit will
kill you now ...

strategy starts to diverge at this point.  note that it is likely that
you still have another normal wish and a low-probability extracted wish
left (keep zapping).

if you're not successful then hopefully you'll at least see the course
you'll need to take in a more normal game.  while a win is a win,
eventually you'll feel "better" if you get a win without wishing your
way to the top (in my opinion).

